{
  "datasets": [
    {
      "name": "superstore_orders",
      "displayName": "Superstore Orders",
      "config": {
        "source": "dbacademy.default.superstore_cleaned",
        "measures": [
          {
            "name": "total_sales",
            "expr": "SUM(`Sales`)",
            "displayName": "Total Sales",
            "format": {
              "type": "currency",
              "currencyCode": "USD",
              "abbreviation": "compact"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "total_profit",
            "expr": "SUM(`Profit`)",
            "displayName": "Total Profit",
            "format": {
              "type": "currency",
              "currencyCode": "USD",
              "abbreviation": "compact"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "total_quantity",
            "expr": "SUM(`Quantity`)",
            "displayName": "Total Quantity"
          },
          {
            "name": "customer_count",
            "expr": "COUNT(DISTINCT `Customer_ID`)",
            "displayName": "Total Customers"
          },
          {
            "name": "profit_margin_pct",
            "expr": "SUM(`Profit`) / SUM(`Sales`) * 100",
            "displayName": "Profit Margin %",
            "comment": "Overall profit margin - total profit divided by total sales, as a percentage"
          }
        ],
        "version": "1.1",
        "comment": "Superstore order line metrics for sales, profit, quantity, customers, and profit margin",
        "dimensions": [
          {
            "name": "Order_Date",
            "expr": "`Order_Date`"
          },
          {
            "name": "Ship_Mode",
            "expr": "`Ship_Mode`"
          },
          {
            "name": "Customer_ID",
            "expr": "`Customer_ID`"
          },
          {
            "name": "Segment",
            "expr": "`Segment`"
          },
          {
            "name": "Region",
            "expr": "`Region`"
          },
          {
            "name": "State",
            "expr": "`State`"
          },
          {
            "name": "Category",
            "expr": "`Category`"
          },
          {
            "name": "Sub_Category",
            "expr": "`Sub-Category`"
          },
          {
            "name": "Product_Name",
            "expr": "`Product_Name`"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "00f27651",
      "displayName": "Superstore Sales Analytics Dashboard",
      "layout": [
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "dashboard_title",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "# SUPERSTORE SALES DASHBOARD"
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 2,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 10,
            "height": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "insights_panel",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## INSIGHTS\n",
                "- The **Consumer** segment is the top revenue contributor (51% of sales).\n",
                "- **Standard Class** is the most popular shipping mode; **Same Day** is the least.\n",
                "- **West** and **East** lead in sales and profit, driven by California and New York.\n",
                "- **Technology** is the top category (36% of sales); **Phones** is the best-selling sub-category.\n",
                "- **November** has the highest revenue of any month."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 2,
            "height": 11
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "kpi_total_sales",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "main_query",
                "query": {
                  "datasetName": "superstore_orders",
